The delivery days in data/source are the anonymised dataset published with the compact-routing
repository (Papară & Crișan, 2026, https://github.com/cezarpapara/compact-routing, CC BY-NC 4.0),
collected with the approval of the management of S.C. DEDEMAN S.R.L. under GDPR and
business-confidentiality requirements: no customer identifiers, no addresses (coordinates rounded to a
delivery area), no calendar dates. The customer messages are synthetic: they were written by the
authors and no real customer text is included.
